      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "6 below-market units. An earlier 26-unit proposal here expired.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001554"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The May 2025 council report lists APNs 529-28-001 and -002, property owner David Blatt, CSPN LLC, and applicant Kenneth Rodrigues and Partners, Inc. SF YIMBY names Capstack Partners as developer.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003699",
        "SRC-003698",
        "SRC-003700"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQA document: SB 330 application invoking builder's remedy; four-story, 52 ft mixed-use building with underground parking, 2,416 sq ft ground-floor commercial and 30 units (24 market rate, 6 affordable). Two garage options: 47 stalls on two levels, or 39 stalls on one level with 16 car stackers.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003696"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Town Council approved 3-2 on May 27, 2025; Mayor Matthew Hudes and Councilmember Mary Badame voted no. Conditions require the developer to meet regularly with school staff and limit construction traffic at peak school times.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003697",
        "SRC-003702"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY reports about 78,580 sq ft total: 32,750 sq ft housing, 2,400 sq ft retail and a 31,000 sq ft garage; unit mix 15 one-bedroom, 13 two-bedroom, 2 three-bedroom.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003698"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Cushman & Wakefield lists the site for sale as fully entitled land for 30 for-sale condominiums with about 2,416 sq ft of ground-floor retail on 0.43 acres; price on request.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State report 2025 row: 6 low-income deed-restricted units for 55 years, required under Government Code 65589.5; 12 development standard modifications.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001121"
      ]
    }
